{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35338","headline":"兴善寺贝多树 · 张乔","name":"兴善寺贝多树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"还应毫末长，始见拂丹霄。\n得子从西国，成阴见昔朝。\n势随双刹直，寒出四墙遥。\n带月啼春鸟，连空噪暝蜩。\n远根穿古井，高顶起凉飙。\n影动悬灯夜，声繁过雨朝。\n静迟松桂老，坚任雪霜凋。\n永共终南在，应随劫火烧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35338.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35338","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}